
graph_type:

  banded_c0:
    - 1's on diagonal
    - 0.3 on off diagonal
    - doesn't change over time
    - adj_params = [value = 1, rho = 0.3]
    - y_c doesn't affect precision, AND y_c_k's are all the same
    
    
  banded_c1:
    - 1's on diagonal
    - 0.3 on off diagonal
    - doesn't change over time
    - adj_params = [y_min = 0, y_max = 1, rho = 0.3]
    - y_c doesn't affect precision, BUT y_c_k's are different (to see if things still hold)
    
  banded_v1:
    - rho = 0.3
    - width increase each week
    - naive. Doesn't account for breaking PSD
    
